EventDesk Alembic environment

From the repository root, run:

    python -m alembic -c backend/alembic.ini <command>

Alternatively, from the backend directory, run:

    python -m alembic -c alembic.ini <command>

The database URL is loaded from the repository-root .env file. Alembic imports
Base from app.database.model_registry so every model is available to
autogenerate.

No revision is included in this setup phase.
